Z||000000||Fiero_Freak||03-19-2001||08:21 PM||||I have looked and haven't really found answers to these questions.  I have a 95 Camaro 3.4.<P>1. Is there any diff in the heads as compared to the 2.8.  ie, which should I use?<P>2.  On the oil pan...what is that sensor?  Or can I use my 87 pan?  <P>And finally<BR>3. The oil pressure sensor...what that boss there talking about?  Anyone have any ideas on the part I need to get to make it work?<P>Thanks for the help.<P>||||reg||5
